  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anti Corruption Evidence &apos; ACE&apos; Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACE delivers new practical research about what works to tackle corruption, illicit financial flows and serious organised crime. The approach is problem-led, not starting with preconceived ideas about the &#x2018;right&#x2019; solutions, it focuses on real world priorities, and it takes politics seriously, developing politically viable reforms and approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
